  "title": "Italian Sausage Stuffed Shells",
  "description": "Jumbo pasta shells are stuffed with Italian sausage and shredded mozzarella cheese, topped with marinara sauce and more cheese then baked until bubbly and browned.",
  "authors": [
    "RainbowJewels"
  ],
